  "title": "Open-interest expansion and direction-dependent BTC return asymmetry",
  "claim": "Does point-in-time open-interest expansion accompanying a completed 15m BTCUSDT return predict direction-dependent BTCUSDT close-to-close return over the next 60m, after controlling for prior return, realized volatility, funding-cycle position, and liquidity?",
